      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARMOURY (5) finished third as the $2.80 favourite last start, beaten 17 metres at Mildura over 2190m after she led at the bell. Talented and has plenty of upside. This looks a sterner test than last time but she is good enough to take this out. ASHANTE WARRIOR (2) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 4 metres from the winner in third over 1790m at Mildura after racing three-wide over the middle stages. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Finds a tougher race but he has the ability to test this field. MASTER MIKI (4) disappointed last time when seventh over 2190m at this track after having raced four-back on the fence at the bell. Can do a lot better. COLBY ART (1) used the sprint lane to score as the favourite over 1690m at this track a week ago. Harder here but has upside so is worth including in exotic bets.",
